<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight rates up, one-week slip.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight rates up, one-week slip.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound rose on Wednesday in a liquid private sector market to between 9 3/4 and 10 1/8 percent from Tuesday's range of 9 3/4 and 10 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week pound rates slipped to 9 3/4 and 10 1/8 percent from 10 and 10 1/4 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>State-owned banks kept their minimum lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
</text>
